<section class="methodology" id="methodology">
  <div class="methodology-inner">
    <div class="section-label">How we review</div>
    <h2 class="section-headline">One rubric. Every clinic. Zero editorial shortcuts.</h2>
    <p class="section-body">Every clinic is scored on the same 10 dimensions. We do not adjust weights based on affiliate relationship or traffic potential. The methodology page explains every scoring decision in full.</p>

    <div class="rubric-grid">
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">01</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Pricing transparency</h3>
          <p>Full cost visible upfront — medications, labs, consults, and any activation fees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">02</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Medical oversight</h3>
          <p>Board-certified MD/DO prescribers, not PAs or NPs standing in for complex cases.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">03</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Lab protocol</h3>
          <p>Baseline bloodwork required. Follow-up labs at least every 6 months.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">04</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Medication variety</h3>
          <p>Injectables, gels, pellets, and enclomiphene available — not a one-size-fits-all model.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">05</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Fertility support</h3>
          <p>hCG and related protocols available for men who want to preserve testicular function.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">06</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Patient support</h3>
          <p>Response time, support channel quality, and escalation path documented.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">07</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Onboarding speed</h3>
          <p>Time from signup to first medication delivery, tested end-to-end.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">08</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Subscription flexibility</h3>
          <p>Month-to-month availability, cancellation process, and commitment requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">09</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>Refund policy</h3>
          <p>Medications, membership fees, and lab costs — and how easy the process is.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric-item">
        <div class="rubric-num">10</div>
        <div class="rubric-content">
          <h3>User experience</h3>
          <p>App or portal quality, lab kit clarity, shipping reliability, and communication tone.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="methodology-cta">
      <a href="#" class="text-link">Read the full methodology &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>